    "id": "corpse_in_the_road_note",
    "text": [
      "Searching the corpse, you find a small pouch of coins and a strange note tucked inside one of its pockets.",
      "\"The handle shall reveal whether this is truly The Bearer’s Sword\"",
      "Unsure of its meaning, {PlayerName} keeps the note, hoping to find someone who might know more about the mysterious blade."
