  {
    "id": "quiet_town_arrival",
    "text": [
      "You arrive in a quiet town. Far too quiet for this time of the year.",
      "The streets are completely deserted, and the air feels unusually heavy. Something is not right here."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "text": "Check if there is something suspicious",
        "outcome": {
          "successChance": 30,
          "skillCheck": {
            "stat": "intelligence",
            "bonusPerPoint": 5
          },
          "nextEventId": "quiet_town_strange_house",
          "failEventId": "quiet_town_ignored",
          "successStatChanges": { "exp": 5 },
          "failStatChanges": { "exp": 1 }
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "Ignore the town and move onwards",
        "outcome": {
          "successStatChanges": { "exp": 1 }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "quiet_town_ignored",
    "poolExcluded": true,
    "text": [
      "You wander around the empty alleys for a while, but notice nothing out of the ordinary. You decide it's best to move onwards."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "text": "Leave the town",
        "outcome": {
          "successStatChanges": { "exp": 1 }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "quiet_town_strange_house",
    "poolExcluded": true,
    "text": [
      "Investigating the area, you come across a strange house from which whispered voices can be heard.",
      "Inside, several villagers are gathered, staring blankly into the void. You ask them what is happening, but they do not answer, seemingly lost in a deep trance."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "text": "Leave them alone and walk away",
        "outcome": {
          "successStatChanges": { "exp": 2, "morality": 5 }
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "Attack them",
        "outcome": {
          "successStatChanges": { "exp": 5, "morality": -10 },
          "combat": "hypnotized_villagers",
          "combatLoseEventId": "quiet_town_combat_lost",
          "combatWinEventId": "quiet_town_combat_won"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "Search the room",
        "outcome": {
          "successChance": 20,
          "skillCheck": {
            "stat": "intelligence",
            "bonusPerPoint": 5
          },
          "nextEventId": "quiet_town_found_crystal",
          "failEventId": "quiet_town_failed_search",
          "successStatChanges": { "exp": 15 },
          "failStatChanges": { "exp": 2 }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "quiet_town_failed_search",
    "poolExcluded": true,
    "text": [
